# COMSOL Multiphysics AC/DC Coil Template (Placeholder)
# Filename: pfr_coil_acdc_axisym.mph
#
# This is a placeholder for the actual COMSOL .mph binary file.
# When COMSOL is available, this model should be created with the following specification.
#
# ============================================================================
# MODEL SPECIFICATION: PFR AC/DC Coil - 2D Axisymmetric
# ============================================================================
#
# Module: AC/DC
# Dimension: 2D Axisymmetric (r-z coordinates)
# Study: Frequency Domain (time-harmonic at f_RF)
#
# ============================================================================
# GEOMETRY (comp1/geom1)
# ============================================================================
#
# Domain 1: Gas Region (interior)
#   - Rectangle: r=[0, R_tube_inner], z=[0, L_reactor]
#   - Material: Air/H2 mixture (parameterized)
#   - Conductivity: sigma_eff (parameter for Q_RF calculation)
#
# Domain 2: Quartz Tube
#   - Rectangle: r=[R_tube_inner, R_tube_outer], z=[0, L_reactor]
#   - Material: Quartz (SiO2)
#   - epsilon_r = 3.75
#   - Electrical insulator
#
# Domain 3: Coil Region (external current source)
#   - Multi-turn coil approximation
#   - Circles/rectangles at z_coil_start to z_coil_end
#   - n_turns total turns
#   - Wire cross-section: r_wire (for current density calculation)
#
# ============================================================================
# PARAMETERS (Global Definitions)
# ============================================================================
#
# Geometry:
#   R_tube_inner    [m]   Inner radius of quartz tube (default: 50.8e-3)
#   R_tube_outer    [m]   Outer radius of quartz tube (R_tube_inner + wall_thickness)
#   L_reactor       [m]   Total reactor length (default: 200e-3)
#   z_coil_start    [m]   Axial start of coil region (default: 50e-3)
#   z_coil_end      [m]   Axial end of coil region (default: 150e-3)
#   n_turns         [-]   Number of coil turns (default: 5)
#   r_coil          [m]   Coil mean radius (default: R_tube_outer + 10e-3)
#   r_wire          [m]   Wire radius (default: 2e-3)
#
# Operating Conditions:
#   I_coil          [A]   Coil current amplitude (default: 10)
#   f_RF            [Hz]  RF frequency (default: 13.56e6)
#   sigma_eff       [S/m] Effective plasma conductivity (default: 0.01)
#
# Derived:
#   omega           [rad/s] Angular frequency = 2*pi*f_RF
#
# ============================================================================
# PHYSICS: Magnetic Fields (mf) - AC/DC Module
# ============================================================================
#
# Equation: Time-harmonic magnetic fields
#   ∇×(μ⁻¹∇×A) + jωσA = J_ext
#
# Where:
#   A = magnetic vector potential (azimuthal component in axisym)
#   J_ext = external current density from coil
#   σ = electrical conductivity (sigma_eff in gas, 0 in quartz)
#
# Boundary Conditions:
#   - Axis (r=0): Axial symmetry
#   - Outer boundaries: Magnetic insulation (n×A=0)
#
# Coil Excitation:
#   - External Current Density feature
#   - J_phi = n_turns * I_coil / A_coil
#   - Where A_coil = cross-sectional area of coil region
#
# ============================================================================
# COMPUTED FIELDS
# ============================================================================
#
# Primary Fields (from mf physics):
#   - mf.Br: Radial magnetic field component [T]
#   - mf.Bz: Axial magnetic field component [T]
#   - mf.normB: Magnetic field magnitude |B| [T]
#   - mf.Ephi: Induced azimuthal electric field [V/m]
#   - mf.normE: Electric field magnitude |E| [V/m]
#
# Derived Fields:
#   - B_mag = mf.normB [T]
#   - E_mag = mf.normE [V/m]
#   - Q_RF = 0.5 * sigma_eff * mf.normE^2 [W/m³]
#     (Time-averaged Ohmic heating in gas region only)
#
# ============================================================================
# MESH (mesh1)
# ============================================================================
#
# - Free triangular mesh
# - Finer mesh in gas region near coil
# - Maximum element size: L_reactor / 50
# - Minimum element size: L_reactor / 500
# - Boundary layer on tube walls (optional)
#
# ============================================================================
# STUDY (std1)
# ============================================================================
#
# Type: Frequency Domain
# Frequency: f_RF (13.56 MHz)
#
# Solver Configuration:
#   - MUMPS direct solver
#   - Relative tolerance: 1e-6
#
# ============================================================================
# EXPORT DATASETS
# ============================================================================
#
# Grid export on (r, z) mesh matching PFR schema:
#   r = linspace(0, R_tube_inner, 100)
#   z = linspace(0, L_reactor, 200)
#
# Fields to export:
#   - B_mag(r,z)   → /em/B_mag   [T]
#   - E_mag(r,z)   → /em/E_mag   [V/m]
#   - Q_RF(r,z)    → /em/Q_RF    [W/m³]
#
# ============================================================================
# PARAMETER SWEEP (optional study)
# ============================================================================
#
# For sigma_eff sweep:
#   sigma_eff = [0.001, 0.01, 0.1, 1.0, 10.0] S/m
#
# For I_coil sweep:
#   I_coil = [1, 5, 10, 20, 50] A
#
# ============================================================================
# END OF SPECIFICATION
# ============================================================================
